  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "*Contact owner for accurate price quote. Complimentary pool heating Nov. 1, 2025 - May 1, 2026. <br><br>Rest and relaxation is the name of the game at the fully renovated Giant’s Rest! Located in the quiet, peaceful community of Inlet Beach, this coastal 3-story, 6-bedroom plus game room, 4-bath home is the perfect spot for a beach vacation. Beautiful gulf views and breathtaking sunsets can be enjoyed from the two outdoor decks, while the private heated pool beckons below. The house was completely renovated in 2025, including all new kitchen, bathrooms, paint, fans, window blinds and door shades, electrical outlets and switches and many upgraded furnishings.<br><br>The third floor offers the luxurious master bedroom and bath which opens up to a shared balcony with gorgeous ocean views and a wonderful ocean breeze. Catch the sunrise on the balcony or relax at night, soaking in the new standalone tub, to the sounds of the ocean waves. Features a 42” Smart TV, king bed, reading chair, ceiling fan, separate huge walk-in shower and standalone soaking tub. A second master bedroom and private bath shares the balcony and spectacular views and completes the top floor. Features a Smart TV, king bed, ceiling fan, and new walk-in shower.<br><br>The second floor offers the Living, Dining and Kitchen area as well as 2 bedrooms that sleep a total of 9. The Living area features a 60” Smart TV, pull out sofa, full renovated bath with new walk-in shower, large deck for outdoor dining and entertainment. Large family style dining area includes service for 24, a table for 10 plus additional seating allows for indoor seating up to 14. Beautiful fully renovated kitchen with gorgeous marble countertops, stainless steel appliances, and all the essential tools for a perfect vacation! Coffee bar area includes a new drink fridge. Down the hall, kids will enjoy the bunk room featuring two sets of bunk beds (one double, one twin) with twin trundle (sleeps up to 7), and Smart TV. The back bedroom consists of a king bed, Smart TV, and access to the outside deck. Full-size Washer & Dryer also located on this floor.<br><br>The first floor offers two bedrooms that sleep a total of 5. The kids’ bedroom features three twin beds. The cozy Queen bedroom allows access to the pool area and has a Smart TV. The first floor also hosts a game room that opens up to the pool, featuring a 42” Smart TV and all new furnishings, including a comfortable pull-out couch. It’s a great place to put the excited kids or rowdy teenagers for after-dinner entertainment!<br><br>Giant’s Rest has an outdoor area that is perfect to enjoy the Florida Sunshine. A renovated large back yard patio offers a private heated pool and lounging deck, gas grill and plenty of outdoor seating. Parking is perfect because the house features a two-car garage and space for 4 cars in the driveway. For a large group, there is a second full-size refrigerator located in the garage for all your refreshment needs.<br><br>Giant’s Rest is just steps away from the secluded beaches of Inlet Beach, a hidden treasure at the eastern end of Highway 30-A and immediately east of Rosemary Beach. Enjoy the restaurants, shopping and recreational activities of 30-A, while staying at a quiet get-away in Inlet Beach. Make Giant’s Rest your next beach destination!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
